                    "message": "Don't forget to add"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vernon Mauery",
                        "email": "vernon.mauery@gmail.com",
                        "username": "vmauery"
                    },
                    "message": "Don't forget to add an NVIDIA user to the OWNERS file in the root dir of the repo with the path of oem/nvidia\n\nIf I understand correctly, this allows the person in the owners file to have +2 privileges for their own code."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Prithvi Pai",
                        "email": "prithvi24pai@gmail.com",
                        "username": "PrithviPai24"
                    },
                    "message": "Added NVIDIA users to owner file"
                },
                {
                    "file": "oem/nvidia/biosconfigcommands.cpp",
                    "line": 35,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vernon Mauery",
                        "email": "vernon.mauery@gmail.com",
                        "username": "vmauery"
                    },
                    "message": "This function is only ever just returning a completion code, so it's signature should probably be: ipmi::RspType<>"
                },
                {
                    "file": "oem/nvidia/biosconfigcommands.cpp",
                    "line": 35,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Prithvi Pai",
                        "email": "prithvi24pai@gmail.com",
                        "username": "PrithviPai24"
                    },
                    "message": "Addressed"
                },
                {
                    "file": "oem/nvidia/biosconfigcommands.cpp",
                    "line": 48,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vernon Mauery",
                        "email": "vernon.mauery@gmail.com",
                        "username": "vmauery"
                    },
                    "message": "you might consider replacing all the key names with constexpr variables so that any typos will be caught by the compiler rather than showing up as runtime bugs.\n\n```\nconstexpr char keyHashAlgo[] = \"HashAlgo\";\n...\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "oem/nvidia/biosconfigcommands.cpp",
                    "line": 48,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Prithvi Pai",
                        "email": "prithvi24pai@gmail.com",
                        "username": "PrithviPai24"
                    },
                    "message": "Addressed"
                },
                {
                    "file": "oem/nvidia/biosconfigcommands.cpp",
                    "line": 93,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vernon Mauery",
                        "email": "vernon.mauery@gmail.com",
                        "username": "vmauery"
                    },
                    "message": "It's is nice to put each of the return types on a separate line to document them:\n```\nipmi:RspType<\n    uint8_t, // action\n    std::array<uint8_t, biosPasswordSaltSize>, // salt\n    std::array<uint8_t, biosPasswordHashSize>  // hash\n>\n```"
                },
                {
